<title>HUNGARY: CESI index ends practically unchanged.</title>
<headline>CESI index ends practically unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index closed practically unchanged on Wednesday as it ended at 1,507.65 points, up 0.72 points or 0.05 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index edged up as prices firmed in Warsaw, were stable in Prague and declined in Budapest.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
</text>
